# Only the recorded demo site is deployed.
#
# This uses the documented allowlist form: ignore everything at the project
# root, then re-include just what the static site needs. Excluding app/ and
# requirements.txt is not only about upload size - it stops Vercel's framework
# detection finding a FastAPI entrypoint and trying to run the application as a
# serverless function, which it cannot be. See docs/deployment.md.

/*
!demo
!vercel.json

# The demo's Python helpers produce and sync the site; they are development
# tools and are not part of what gets served.
demo/*.py
demo/__pycache__
